--- /dev/null
+++ b/test-apps/v33-icbc/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+# V3.3 ICBC integration test
+
+`validate-v33-icbc.sh <adb-serial>` launches the installed `com.icbc.elife` sample with the
+write watcher enabled. It validates the stable-snapshot report:
+
+- a `phase3-write-repairs.tsv` sidecar is emitted under the process session;
+- its rows expose the DEX method identity and both encoded `code_off` field locations;
+- at least one snapshot-proven `code_off_retargeted` row has a resolved DEX descriptor.
+
+The script never enables a non-zero V3 execution budget and clears all capture/watch properties
+on exit. It therefore observes the protector's startup repair but does not actively invoke app
+methods.
